// Read by the VS Code extension (DavidAnson.vscode-markdownlint) only, which runs
// the markdownlint-cli2 engine. The CLI is markdownlint-cli and does not read this
// file: it takes its ignore patterns from .markdownlintignore. The two lists hold
// the same four patterns, spelled the same way. Change both together. Rules live
// in .markdownlint.json, which both read.
//
// `.revloop/field-notes.md` is the one artifact the procedure writes: git-
// ignored, local, and one long line per event, which puts it past MD013
// immediately. Linting it made following the procedure turn `npm run check:all`
// red. The pattern names that file rather than the directory, so any other
// Markdown someone leaves in `.revloop/` is still linted — excluding the whole
// directory removes more than the collision it was added for.
{
  "ignores": ["node_modules/**", ".git/**", "tests/fixtures/**", ".revloop/field-notes.md"]
}
